00:13:56,500 --> 00:13:57,020
Where?

280
00:13:57,020 --> 00:14:04,240
Oh, crap!

281
00:14:04,700 --> 00:14:05,060
Neen?

282
00:14:06,440 --> 00:14:07,380
Why, you?

283
00:14:07,760 --> 00:14:08,740
I've got more.

284
00:14:10,020 --> 00:14:11,420
What's up with this kid?

285
00:14:13,980 --> 00:14:14,840
Hold on.

286
00:14:15,160 --> 00:14:17,260
There's something strange going on with this guy.

287
00:14:17,620 --> 00:14:19,620
He never even tried to dodge my attacks,

288
00:14:19,840 --> 00:14:22,300
but he's doing whatever he can to avoid Black Stars.

289
00:14:22,680 --> 00:14:23,700
Why is that?

290
00:14:25,960 --> 00:14:26,520
Oh!

291
00:14:26,520 --> 00:14:30,960
Now I see he tricked us.

292
00:14:31,700 --> 00:14:32,560
What'd you say?

293
00:14:32,940 --> 00:14:34,060
What are you doing?

294
00:14:34,320 --> 00:14:35,780
You want me to tear you up?

295
00:14:36,400 --> 00:14:38,480
Into eight pieces, if you don't mind.

296
00:14:38,760 --> 00:14:39,440
Go right ahead.

297
00:14:39,500 --> 00:14:40,360
I won't stop you.

298
00:14:41,360 --> 00:14:42,060
Oh, wait.

299
00:14:42,580 --> 00:14:45,100
In your current form, you can't touch me, can you?

300
00:14:45,380 --> 00:14:45,780
Hmph.

301
00:14:47,100 --> 00:14:48,880
Finally figured it out, did you?

302
00:14:55,260 --> 00:14:55,740
Hey!

303
00:14:55,900 --> 00:14:56,160
Hey!

304
00:14:56,760 --> 00:14:57,020
What?

305
00:14:58,260 --> 00:15:01,340
I take it this is a spell cast by the magic eye.

306
00:15:01,340 --> 00:15:03,940
Yeah, called forwarding vision.

307
00:15:03,940 --> 00:15:06,640
It's a type of spatial magic.

308
00:15:07,380 --> 00:15:10,940
It displays a live image of me while I'm somewhere else entirely.

309
00:15:10,940 --> 00:15:13,540
How dare you do that on top of Tadpole Jackson?

310
00:15:13,540 --> 00:15:15,600
You'll pay for this, you beast!

311
00:15:15,600 --> 00:15:17,500
I didn't have any other choice.

312
00:15:17,500 --> 00:15:20,140
This was the only way we could delay them and keep moving.

313
00:15:21,080 --> 00:15:22,460
What gave me away?

314
00:15:22,460 --> 00:15:28,560
You never tried to avoid any of the bullets I shot in your direction, but you didn't want

315
00:15:28,560 --> 00:15:31,160
any of Black Star's blade attacks to hit you.

316
00:15:31,160 --> 00:15:34,540
Because they would go right through you without resistance and we'd realize that you were nothing

317
00:15:34,540 --> 00:15:35,140
more than an image.

318
00:15:35,140 --> 00:15:39,720
I assume the initial cannon blast came from behind the projection.

319
00:15:39,720 --> 00:15:42,320
You had to make the image look like the real deal.

320
00:15:42,320 --> 00:15:47,000
The fact that people generally prefer to attack immortals from a distance worked in your favor, too.

321
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:48,860
I'm sure you were counting on that.

322
00:15:48,860 --> 00:15:50,200
All in all, it was a nice trick.

323
00:15:51,340 --> 00:15:54,200
What I want to know is why you didn't notice when you stabbed him!

324
00:15:55,300 --> 00:15:56,940
Hey! I'm Black Star!

325
00:15:57,340 --> 00:16:01,680
I figured my attacks were so awesome that my blade just slipped right through him without me feeling anything!

326
00:16:02,080 --> 00:16:02,520
Really?

327
00:16:03,180 --> 00:16:05,060
