328
00:16:06,360 --> 00:16:09,460
I just figured he'd improved a lot, but I guess I was wrong.

329
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:11,800
Oh, wow.

330
00:16:12,620 --> 00:16:14,320
Weapons love blindly, don't they?

331
00:16:15,660 --> 00:16:16,100
